Reset your password
===================

We received a request to reset the password for <%= @employee.email_address %>.

Choose a new password here:
<%= edit_password_url(@employee.password_reset_token) %>

This link will expire in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @employee.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.

If you didn't ask to reset your password, you can safely ignore this email.

— Vet
